{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "地址上的委托",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 138.53,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "再看 EIP-7702，它在 2025 年 5 月，随 Pectra 升级上线。",
   "spoken": "再看 EIP-7702，它在 2025 年 5 月，随 Pectra 升级上线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 6.6,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 7.364
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "普通地址可以签一份授权，里面写三样东西。",
   "spoken": "普通地址可以签一份授权，里面写三样东西。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 8.42,
   "dur": 4.104,
   "speechStart": 8.518,
   "speechEnd": 11.684
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "链 ID、委托合约的地址、nonce。",
   "spoken": "链 ID、委托合约的地址、nonce。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.744,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 12.842,
   "speechEnd": 15.949
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "签完，这个地址的代码，变成一个指针，指向那个合约。",
   "spoken": "签完，这个地址的代码，变成一个指针，指向那个合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.996,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 17.094,
   "speechEnd": 21.379
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "从此，这个地址执行的，是那个合约的代码。",
   "spoken": "从此，这个地址执行的，是那个合约的代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.424,
   "dur": 4.44,
   "speechStart": 22.522,
   "speechEnd": 26.022
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "这就是委托，它是写在地址上的链上状态。",
   "spoken": "这就是委托，它是写在地址上的链上状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.084,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 27.182,
   "speechEnd": 30.301
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "风险有三层。",
   "spoken": "风险有三层。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 31.36,
   "dur": 2.28,
   "speechStart": 31.458,
   "speechEnd": 32.803
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "第一层，委托给恶意合约，它的代码可以转走全部资产。",
   "spoken": "第一层，委托给恶意合约，它的代码可以转走全部资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.86,
   "dur": 5.448,
   "speechStart": 33.958,
   "speechEnd": 38.47
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "第二层，链 ID 填 0，授权在所有支持它的 EVM 链上都有效。",
   "spoken": "第二层，链 ID 填 0，授权在所有支持它的 EVM 链上都有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.528,
   "dur": 6.072,
   "speechStart": 39.626,
   "speechEnd": 44.768
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "前提只是，那条链上这个地址的 nonce 对得上。",
   "spoken": "前提只是，那条链上这个地址的 nonce 对得上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 45.82,
   "dur": 4.2,
   "speechStart": 45.918,
   "speechEnd": 49.191
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "链 ID 是 0 的授权，钱包应该默认拒绝。",
   "spoken": "链 ID 是 0 的授权，钱包应该默认拒绝。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 50.24,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "speechStart": 50.338,
   "speechEnd": 53.647
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "第三层最常见，委托合约是合法的，用户却签了一个批量执行。",
   "spoken": "第三层最常见，委托合约是合法的，用户却签了一个批亮执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 54.708,
   "dur": 6.384,
   "speechStart": 54.806,
   "speechEnd": 60.246
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "批量里的内容，是转走资产。",
   "spoken": "批亮里的内容，是转走资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 61.312,
   "dur": 3.216,
   "speechStart": 61.41,
   "speechEnd": 63.683
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "2025 年 5 月，一名用户这样损失了约 14.6 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 5 月，一名用户这样损失了约 14.6 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 64.748,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 64.846,
   "speechEnd": 68.988
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "2025 年 8 月，ScamSniffer 记录到两起同类钓鱼，约 100 万和 154 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 8 月，ScamSniffer 记录到两起同类钓鱼，约 100 万和 154 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 70.056,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 70.154,
   "speechEnd": 76.416
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "Wintermute 的统计显示，绝大部分委托，指向同一类复制来的扫币合约。",
   "spoken": "Wintermute 的统计显示，绝大部分委托，指向同一类复制来的扫币合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 77.476,
   "dur": 5.904,
   "speechStart": 77.574,
   "speechEnd": 82.55
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "它们专门扫走，私钥已经泄露的地址收到的 ETH。",
   "spoken": "它们专门扫走，私钥已经泄漏的地址收到的 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 83.6,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "speechStart": 83.698,
   "speechEnd": 87.019
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "主要风险，不在恶意合约，而在对合法合约发出的恶意批量。",
   "spoken": "主要风险，不在恶意合约，而在对合法合约发出的恶意批亮。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 88.068,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 88.166,
   "speechEnd": 92.82
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "钱包必须把批量里的每一步，逐项解码给用户看。",
   "spoken": "钱包必须把批亮里的每一步，逐项解码给用户看。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 93.88,
   "dur": 4.152,
   "speechStart": 93.978,
   "speechEnd": 97.204
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "开发者也有三个坑。",
   "spoken": "开发者也有三个坑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-19.mp3",
   "start": 98.252,
   "dur": 2.448,
   "speechStart": 98.35,
   "speechEnd": 99.862
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "委托时不运行初始化代码，攻击者可以抢先初始化。",
   "spoken": "委托时不运行初始化代码，攻击者可以抢先初始化。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-20.mp3",
   "start": 100.92,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 101.018,
   "speechEnd": 105.053
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "所以初始化数据，要由这个地址的私钥签名。",
   "spoken": "所以初始化数据，要由这个地址的私钥签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-21.mp3",
   "start": 106.108,
   "dur": 4.44,
   "speechStart": 106.206,
   "speechEnd": 109.706
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "换委托合约时，旧存储仍在，新合约会读到错的数据。",
   "spoken": "换委托合约时，旧存储仍在，新合约会读到错的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-22.mp3",
   "start": 110.768,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 110.866,
   "speechEnd": 115.389
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-23",
   "text": "要用命名空间存储，把两份数据隔开。",
   "spoken": "要用命名空间存储，把两份数据隔开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-23.mp3",
   "start": 116.46,
   "dur": 3.864,
   "speechStart": 116.558,
   "speechEnd": 119.486
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-24",
   "text": "交易发起者等于调用者，这个老检查，不再能证明对方是普通地址。",
   "spoken": "交易发起者等于掉用者，这个老检查，不再能证明对方是普通地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-24.mp3",
   "start": 120.544,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 120.642,
   "speechEnd": 125.701
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-25",
   "text": "EIP-7702 原文写明，应用不应该请求用户签署委托授权。",
   "spoken": "EIP-7702 原文写明，应用不应该请求用户签署委托授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-25.mp3",
   "start": 126.764,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "speechStart": 126.862,
   "speechEnd": 132.04
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-26",
   "text": "网站请你升级成智能账户，默认拒绝。",
   "spoken": "网站请你升级成智能账户，默认拒绝。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg4-26.mp3",
   "start": 133.104,
